
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>V&A Mobilier la Comandă — Botoșani</title>
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;600;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap');

*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}

:root{
  --primary:#2C1810;
  --accent:#B8860B;
  --bg:#FFFFFF;
  --bg-warm:#FDFBF8;
  --bg-section:#F9F6F2;
  --text:#333;
  --text-light:#6B6B6B;
  --text-muted:#999;
  --border:#EDE8E2;
  --whatsapp:#25D366;
  --white:#FFF;
}

body{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);line-height:1.7;overflow-x:hidden}

input[type="radio"][name="page"]{display:none}

/* NAV */
.nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1000;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.97);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);padding:0 60px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:76px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-shrink:0}
.logo-icon{width:40px;height:40px;background:var(--accent);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;flex-shrink:0}
.logo-text{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--primary);white-space:nowrap}
.logo-text span{display:block;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:400;color:var(--text-muted);letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase}
.nav-links{display:flex;flex-shrink:0}
.nav-links label{color:var(--text);padding:26px 22px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.5px;transition:color .3s;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;margin-bottom:-1px;white-space:nowrap}
.nav-links label:hover{color:var(--accent)}
#page-acasa:checked~.nav .nav-links label[for="page-acasa"],
#page-despre:checked~.nav .nav-links label[for="page-despre"],
#page-proiecte:checked~.nav .nav-links label[for="page-proiecte"],
#page-contact:checked~.nav .nav-links label[for="page-contact"]{color:var(--accent);border-bottom-color:var(--accent)}

/* HAMBURGER */
.hamburger{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;cursor:pointer;padding:10px;z-index:1001}
.hamburger span{display:block;width:24px;height:2px;background:var(--primary);transition:all .3s}
.mobile-menu{display:none}

.page{display:none}
#page-acasa:checked~.page-acasa,
#page-despre:checked~.page-despre,
#page-proiecte:checked~.page-proiecte,
#page-contact:checked~.page-contact{display:block}

.hero{min-height:88vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;background:#F5F0EA;padding:60px 40px}
.hero-content{max-width:680px}
.hero-badge{display:inline-block;background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:8px 20px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:30px}
.hero h1{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:var(--primary);font-size:50px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:24px}
.hero h1 em{color:var(--accent);font-style:normal;display:block}
.hero p{color:var(--text-light);font-size:17px;margin-bottom:40px;line-height:1.8;max-width:500px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
.btn{display:inline-block;padding:16px 38px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;transition:all .3s;text-decoration:none}
.btn-primary{background:var(--primary);color:var(--white);border:2px solid var(--primary)}
.btn-primary:hover{background:transparent;color:var(--primary)}

.section-header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:60px}
.section-label{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:16px}
.section-title{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:36px;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.3}
.section-subtitle{color:var(--text-light);font-size:15px;max-width:500px;margin:0 auto}

.features-section{background:var(--bg);padding:100px 60px}
.features-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:40px;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
.feature-card{text-align:center;padding:40px 30px}
.feature-icon{width:56px;height:56px;margin:0 auto 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.feature-icon svg{width:40px;height:40px;stroke:var(--accent);fill:none;stroke-width:1.5}
.feature-card h4{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:12px}
.feature-card p{color:var(--text-light);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8}

.about-section{background:var(--bg-section);padding:100px 60px}
.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.2fr;gap:80px;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;align-items:center}
.about-video{position:relative;width:100%;padding-bottom:75%;background:#000;border:1px solid var(--border);overflow:hidden}
.about-video iframe{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:none}
.about-content h2{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:34px;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:24px;line-height:1.3}
.about-content p{color:var(--text-light);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.9}
.values-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-top:36px}
.value-item{padding:20px;background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--border)}
.value-item h5{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:4px}
.value-item p{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);margin:0}

.video-section{padding:80px 60px;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center}
.video-section h2{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:30px;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:8px}
.video-section p{color:var(--text-muted);font-size:14px;margin-bottom:30px}
.video-wrapper{position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%;height:0;overflow:hidden;background:#000}
.video-wrapper iframe{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:none}

.carousel-wrap{background:var(--bg-section);padding:80px 60px}
.carousel-wrap h3{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:24px;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:24px;text-align:center}
.carousel-container{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;height:340px;overflow:hidden;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto}
.carousel-btn{width:48px;height:48px;background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;z-index:10;transition:all .3s;font-size:22px;color:var(--primary);flex-shrink:0}
.carousel-btn:hover{background:var(--primary);color:var(--white);border-color:var(--primary)}
.carousel-viewport{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;flex:1;overflow:hidden;height:100%}
.carousel-slide{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg-section);transition:all .4s ease;flex-shrink:0}
.carousel-slide img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.carousel-slide .slide-label{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(44,24,16,.85));color:white;padding:30px 14px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;transition:opacity .4s}
.carousel-slide.active .slide-label{opacity:1}
.carousel-slide.side{width:220px;height:180px;opacity:.6;filter:brightness(.8)}
.carousel-slide.active{width:420px;height:300px;opacity:1;filter:none;box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.12)}

.gallery-section{padding:80px 60px;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto}
.category-block{margin-bottom:50px}
.category-block h3{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:22px;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:20px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.subcategory-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:14px}
.subcat-card{background:var(--bg-section);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:16px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .3s;text-align:center}
.subcat-card:hover{border-color:var(--accent);transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}
.subcat-card .thumb{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F5F0EA,#EDE5DB);margin-bottom:10px;overflow:hidden}
.subcat-card .thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.subcat-card span{font-size:13px;color:var(--text);font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;display:block}
.subcat-card small{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:4px;display:block}

/* LIGHTBOX */
.lightbox{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(10,8,6,.92);z-index:9999;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
.lightbox.open{display:flex}
.lightbox-header{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 30px;z-index:10}
.lightbox-title{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:18px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9)}
.lightbox-counter{font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)}
.lightbox-close{width:40px;height:40px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-size:26px;transition:color .3s;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)}
.lightbox-close:hover{color:white;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.5)}
.lightbox-main{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:1;width:100%;padding:80px 20px 120px;gap:20px}
.lightbox-arrow{width:50px;height:50px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-size:28px;transition:all .3s;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);flex-shrink:0}
.lightbox-arrow:hover{color:white;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.4)}
.lightbox-img-wrap{flex:1;max-width:700px;max-height:70vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.lightbox-img-wrap img{max-width:100%;max-height:70vh;object-fit:contain;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.5);border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)}
.lightbox-thumbs{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.6);padding:14px 30px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;overflow-x:auto}
.lightbox-thumbs img{width:60px;height:45px;object-fit:cover;cursor:pointer;opacity:.4;transition:all .3s;border:2px solid transparent;flex-shrink:0}
.lightbox-thumbs img:hover{opacity:.7}
.lightbox-thumbs img.active{opacity:1;border-color:var(--accent)}

/* CONTACT */
.contact-section{background:var(--bg-section);padding:100px 60px}
.contact-inner{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
.contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;margin-top:50px}
.contact-info-block h3{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:22px;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:30px}
.contact-item{display:flex;gap:16px;margin-bottom:24px;align-items:flex-start}
.contact-icon{width:44px;height:44px;background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0}
.contact-icon svg{width:20px;height:20px;stroke:var(--accent);fill:none;stroke-width:1.5}
.contact-details strong{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:2px}
.contact-details span{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-light)}
.whatsapp-block{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:32px;margin-top:36px}
.whatsapp-block h4{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:8px}
.whatsapp-block p{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-light);margin-bottom:20px}
.btn-whatsapp{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--whatsapp);color:white;padding:14px 28px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .3s}
.btn-whatsapp:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(37,211,102,.3)}
.whatsapp-note{margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted)}
.map-container{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--border);height:100%;min-height:400px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.map-container iframe{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:none}

.footer{background:var(--white);border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:30px 60px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted)}

/* ===== RESPONSIVE MOBILE ===== */
@media(max-width:768px){
  /* NAV MOBILE */
  .nav{padding:0 16px;height:60px}
  .logo-icon{width:34px;height:34px;font-size:12px}
  .logo-text{font-size:15px}
  .logo-text span{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1.5px}
  .logo{gap:8px}
  .nav-links{display:none}
  .hamburger{display:flex}
  
  .mobile-menu{
    display:none;
    position:fixed;
    top:60px;
    left:0;
    right:0;
    background:var(--white);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
    z-index:999;
    padding:10px 0;
    box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.08)
  }
  .mobile-menu.open{display:block}
  .mobile-menu label{
    display:block;
    padding:14px 24px;
    font-size:14px;
    font-weight:500;
    color:var(--text);
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:background .2s
  }
  .mobile-menu label:hover{background:var(--bg-section)}

  /* HERO */
  .hero{min-height:70vh;padding:40px 20px}
  .hero h1{font-size:30px}
  .hero-badge{font-size:10px;padding:6px 14px;letter-spacing:1.5px}
  .hero p{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:30px}
  .btn{padding:14px 28px;font-size:12px}

  /* FEATURES */
  .features-section{padding:60px 20px}
  .features-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}
  .feature-card{padding:24px 20px}
  .section-title{font-size:26px}

  /* DESPRE */
  .about-section{padding:60px 20px}
  .about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}
  .about-content h2{font-size:26px}
  .values-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}

  /* VIDEO */
  .video-section{padding:40px 16px}
  .video-section h2{font-size:22px}

  /* CAROUSEL */
  .carousel-wrap{padding:40px 16px}
  .carousel-wrap h3{font-size:20px}
  .carousel-container{height:220px;gap:8px}
  .carousel-btn{width:36px;height:36px;font-size:18px}
  .carousel-slide.active{width:200px;height:180px}
  .carousel-slide.side{width:100px;height:120px}
  .carousel-slide .slide-label{font-size:10px;padding:20px 8px 8px}

  /* GALLERY */
  .gallery-section{padding:40px 16px}
  .section-header{margin-bottom:40px}
  .subcategory-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px}
  .subcat-card{padding:10px}
  .subcat-card span{font-size:12px}
  .category-block h3{font-size:18px}

  /* LIGHTBOX MOBILE */
  .lightbox-header{padding:12px 16px}
  .lightbox-title{font-size:14px}
  .lightbox-counter{font-size:11px}
  .lightbox-close{width:34px;height:34px;font-size:20px}
  .lightbox-main{padding:60px 10px 90px;gap:8px}
  .lightbox-arrow{width:36px;height:36px;font-size:20px}
  .lightbox-img-wrap img{max-height:55vh}
  .lightbox-thumbs{padding:10px 12px;gap:6px}
  .lightbox-thumbs img{width:44px;height:34px}

  /* CONTACT */
  .contact-section{padding:60px 20px}
  .contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}
  .map-container{min-height:280px}
  .whatsapp-block{padding:24px}

  /* FOOTER */
  .footer{padding:20px 16px;font-size:12px}
}

@media(max-width:400px){
  .hero h1{font-size:26px}
  .carousel-slide.active{width:170px;height:150px}
  .carousel-slide.side{width:80px;height:100px}
  .subcategory-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<input type="radio" name="page" id="page-acasa" checked>
<input type="radio" name="page" id="page-despre">
<input type="radio" name="page" id="page-proiecte">
<input type="radio" name="page" id="page-contact">

<nav class="nav">
  <div class="logo">
    <div class="logo-icon">V&A</div>
    <div class="logo-text">V&A Mobilier<span>La Comandă</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="nav-links">
    <label for="page-acasa">Acasă</label>
    <label for="page-despre">Despre Noi</label>
    <label for="page-proiecte">Proiecte</label>
    <label for="page-contact">Contact</label>
  </div>
  <div class="hamburger" onclick="toggleMenu()">
    <span></span><span></span><span></span>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu">
  <label for="page-acasa" onclick="closeMenu()">Acasă</label>
  <label for="page-despre" onclick="closeMenu()">Despre Noi</label>
  <label for="page-proiecte" onclick="closeMenu()">Proiecte</label>
  <label for="page-contact" onclick="closeMenu()">Contact</label>
</div>

<!-- ACASĂ -->
<div class="page page-acasa">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-badge">✦ Din Botoșani, pentru casa ta</div>
      <h1>Mobilier la comandă,<em>creat cu suflet</em></h1>
      <p>Creăm piese unice de mobilier, adaptate perfect spațiului și stilului tău. Fiecare detaliu contează.</p>
      <label for="page-proiecte" class="btn btn-primary">Vezi Proiectele Noastre</label>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="features-section">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-label">De ce să ne alegi</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Mobilier creat cu pasiune,<br>livrat cu mândrie</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg></div>
        <h4>Materiale Premium</h4>
        <p>Folosim doar materiale de cea mai bună calitate, selectate cu grijă pentru fiecare proiect — durabilitate maximă și finisaje impecabile.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-4 0v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83-2.83l.06-.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.68 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1 0-4h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83-2.83l.06.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 4.68a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 2.83l-.06.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 19.4 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"/></svg></div>
        <h4>Atenție la Detalii</h4>
        <p>Fiecare îmbinare, fiecare finisaj este realizat cu precizie și dedicare maximă.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/></svg></div>
        <h4>Făcut cu Suflet</h4>
        <p>Suntem o familie care pune pasiune în fiecare proiect. Mobilierul nostru poartă o poveste.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <footer class="footer">© 2026 V&A Mobilier la Comandă — Orășeni-Deal, Botoșani.</footer>
</div>

<!-- DESPRE NOI -->
<div class="page page-despre">
  <section class="about-section">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-video">
        <iframe src="https://streamable.com/e/q58fqr" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>
      <div class="about-content">
        <h2>Povestea Noastră</h2>
        <p>Suntem Vasile și Alina, doi soți din Botoșani uniți de pasiunea pentru lemn și design. Am pornit această afacere din dorința de a crea mobilier care să transforme casele oamenilor în cămine cu adevărat speciale.</p>
        <p>Cu ani de experiență în prelucrarea lemnului și un ochi atent pentru detalii, fiecare piesă pe care o creăm este rezultatul muncii noastre dedicate.</p>
        <p>Credem că mobilierul bun nu este doar funcțional — el trebuie să spună o poveste și să reziste generațiilor.</p>
        <div class="values-grid">
          <div class="value-item"><h5>✦ Calitate</h5><p>Materiale premium, finisaje impecabile</p></div>
